# owned by app-emulation/horcrux-bin: the manager's VM console needs SPICE (and USB redirection / virtiofs shares for guests); QEMU is
# built with it on every Horcrux server image and, through this file, on every machine that installs the manager.
app-emulation/qemu spice usbredir virtfs vnc zstd
# the Horcrux Console encoder (ffmpeg child process): H.264 (x264) and VP8 (libvpx)
media-video/ffmpeg vpx x264
# ffmpeg (Console encoder) pulls media-libs/harfbuzz (drawtext/libass); harfbuzz's default `cairo` USE (hb-view/hb-shape tools only) dragged x11-libs/cairo into a
# headless server's world update (daily server-systemd red 2026-11-20). Nothing on a Horcrux host needs harfbuzz's cairo tools.
media-libs/harfbuzz -cairo
